# Dev / preview: where Vite proxies /api and /ws (Spring Boot). Change if your API is not on 8080.
# VITE_DEV_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8080
#
# Production build only (ignored during `npm run dev` for API base URL):
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.example.com/api
# VITE_WS_URL=wss://your-api.example.com/ws
